flowchart LR
  Scope[原冻结Scope] --> Envelope[原Owner保护封套]
  Scope --> Check[本次Git输入和原始输出检查]
  Material[完整CAS材料] --> Check
  Check --> Stage[原私有材料文件]
  Stage --> Worker[原小握手worker]
  Plan[原批准参数/环境/能力] --> Launch[原Process绑定]
  Launch --> Worker
  Worker --> Proof[原回执/双流/输入证明]
  Proof --> Completion[有限Completion]
